# The ledger itself IS tracked: it records every variant ever tested, and the
# trial count is what makes a candidate's deflated Sharpe auditable (AGENTS.md).
# A re-run cannot reconstruct it -- different candidates, different history.
# Its -wal/-shm journals stay ignored; they are transient, not the record.
research/ledger.sqlite-wal
research/ledger.sqlite-shm
